  "description": "IJAQOA crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H98 N2 O22 Tm4. From the CIF bond table, Tm1 (Tm) has 8 O neighbors; Tm2 (Tm) has 7 O neighbors; Tm1A (Tm) has 8 O neighbors; Tm2A (Tm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.601-3.994 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.67-113.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C50H98N2O22Tm4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
